  "overview": {
    "title": "The city’s beach",
    "p1": "Quemado Beach is the sandy front of Al Hoceima town — the place most visitors swim first and the easiest shoreline to reach on foot or by short taxi.",
    "p2": "Expect a classic urban Mediterranean beach: services in season, families, and clear views across the bay. It is practical rather than wild; for quieter coves head to Cala Bonita or the park coast.",
    "p3": "Bring sun protection and plan shade in peak summer. Evenings on the nearby corniche pair well with a Quemado afternoon."
  },
